# AI Track

A collection of projects and exercises completed while working through the **01Edu AI track**.

The repository focuses on building practical foundations in mathematics, statistics, machine learning, and applied AI through progressively more complex projects.

## Projects

| Project                                                          | Focus                                                           |
| ---------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
| [`math-skills`](./math-skills)                                   | Statistical and mathematical foundations for AI                 |
| [`linear-stats`](./linear-stats)                                 | Linear statistics and statistical analysis                      |
| [`linear-regression`](./linear-regression)                       | Linear regression, model fitting, predictions, and MSE          |
| [`matrix-factorization-project`](./matrix-factorization-project) | Matrix factorization and dimensionality/recommendation concepts |
| [`spectral-learning-project`](./spectral-learning-project)       | Spectral methods and machine learning                           |
| [`credit-scoring`](./credit-scoring)                             | Credit scoring and predictive modeling                          |
| [`sp500-strategies`](./sp500-strategies)                         | S&P 500 data analysis and trading strategies                    |
| [`backtesting-sp500`](./backtesting-sp500)                       | Backtesting financial strategies on historical data             |
| [`guess-it`](./guess-it)                                         | Algorithmic problem-solving project                             |
| [`guess-it-2`](./guess-it-2)                                     | Extended algorithmic problem-solving project                    |

