* Spectral learning

### Applied AI & Data

* Financial data analysis
* Credit scoring
* S&P 500 strategy development
* Strategy backtesting
* Data-driven decision making

### Algorithms

* Problem decomposition
* Algorithmic thinking
* Python programming
